# JAY development preview — optional variables for scripts/jay-preview.sh.
# Export them in your shell (this file is documentation; the launcher does not
# read it). Never put provider keys or tokens here: the preview deliberately
# starts Hermes with a scrubbed environment and mock data only.

# Port on 127.0.0.1 (the preview never binds a public interface).
# JAY_PREVIEW_PORT=8789

# Isolated state root. Must not be inside ~/.hermes (the launcher refuses).
# JAY_PREVIEW_HOME=$HOME/.jay-preview

# Enable Hermes WebUI password auth for the preview (recommended on shared hosts).
# JAY_PREVIEW_PASSWORD=choose-a-local-password
